221   810D              ; Sweep the nine requested standard PC display resolutions.
222   810D              ; Each mode uses 8-bpp indexed pixels and writes exactly its visible
223   810D              ; framebuffer size. The repeating 00h..FFh pattern exercises all 256
224   810D              ; palette indices. SPACE advances to the next resolution.
